@first_sitting
# prose-audit: Grade A — The certified seats remain visible, while the scene moves immediately to the President, PSL's brokers and Lewica's competing caucuses.
title: The first sitting
new-page: true
call: poland_normalize
on-arrival: {!
if (!Q.trz_inaugurated) {
    Q.formation_president_nominee = "Mateusz Morawiecki";
    Q.formation_presidential_attempt_resolved = 0;
    Q.presidential_majority_designation = 1;
    Q.confidence_stage = 1;
    Q.confidence_mode = "Article 154 presidential first attempt — Morawiecki designation";
}
!}
go-to: autonomous_majority if pis_seats >= sejm_statutory_majority or ko_seats >= sejm_statutory_majority or (not third_way_split and p2050_seats + psl_seats >= sejm_statutory_majority); autonomous_coalition if formation_autonomous_coalition_checked = 0 and pis_seats < sejm_statutory_majority and ko_seats < sejm_statutory_majority and (third_way_split or p2050_seats + psl_seats < sejm_statutory_majority)

= 13 November 2023 — two clocks begin

The certified count has returned an awkward chamber. The numbers below are
public seats; the agreements they imply still have to be made.

<div class="ledger-section ledger-section-first"><div class="ledger-title">The
new Sejm — 460 seats</div>
<div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-pis"><b>PiS</b></span><span>[+ pis_seats +]</span><span>largest right club</span></div>
<div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-ko"><b>KO</b></span><span>[+ ko_seats +]</span><span>civic coalition</span></div>
<div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-p2050"><b>Poland 2050</b></span><span>[+ p2050_seats +]</span><span>[+ third_way_display_name +]</span></div>
<div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-psl"><b>PSL</b></span><span>[+ psl_seats +]</span><span>[+ third_way_display_name +]</span></div>
<div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-lewica"><b>Lewica</b></span><span>[+ left_seats +]</span><span>[+ nowa_lewica_seats +] New Left · [+ razem_seats +] Razem</span></div>
<div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-konf"><b>Konfederacja</b></span><span>[+ konf_seats +]</span><span>federal caucus</span></div>
<div class="ledger-subrow">KO, Poland 2050, PSL and Lewica can together command
<b>[+ coalition_democratic_seats +]</b>. Neither Lewica nor PSL can be treated as
an ornamental signature.</div></div>

[? if not trz_inaugurated: President [+ president_name +] accepts the outgoing
cabinet's resignation but lets it remain as caretaker. The Palace is
constitutionally free to designate a first candidate, and PiS argues that the
largest parliamentary club should receive the attempt. ?]

[? if trz_inaugurated: President Trzaskowski faces the opposite dilemma:
whether respecting the certified parliamentary agreement requires bypassing a
performative Morawiecki attempt. ?]

The Left cannot choose whom the President nominates. It can decide whether the
potential majority behaves like a coalition before any minister exists.

[? if election_march_alignment = "Million Hearts March": The parties already
shared stewards and a closing mobilisation in Warsaw. That operation can now
write a voting protocol without being rebuilt from scratch.?]
[? if election_march_alignment = "PiS convention": The Katowice stage left a
direct PiS campaign channel and a photograph Morawiecki will use when he asks
the Left to keep the filed bargain alive.?]

- @first_democratic_protocol
- @first_presidential_channel
- @first_rural_channel
- @first_morawiecki_continuation
- @trzaskowski_majority_designation

@autonomous_coalition
title: Rival parties test a government without Lewica
on-arrival: {!
Q.formation_autonomous_coalition_checked = 1;
const majority = Math.max(1, Number(Q.sejm_statutory_majority) || 231);
const sharedAutonomous = typeof polandCoalitionModel != "undefined"
    ? polandCoalitionModel.autonomous(Q) : null;
if (!sharedAutonomous) {
const seatMap = {
    pis: Math.max(0, Number(Q.pis_seats) || 0),
    ko: Math.max(0, Number(Q.ko_seats) || 0),
    p2050: Math.max(0, Number(Q.p2050_seats) || 0),
    psl: Math.max(0, Number(Q.psl_seats) || 0),
    konf: Math.max(0, Number(Q.konf_seats) || 0)
};
const relation = function(key) {
    return Math.max(0, Number(Q["rival_relation_" + key]) || 0);
};
const candidates = [
    {code: "ko_p2050", label: "KO + Poland 2050", members: ["ko", "p2050"], gates: ["ko_p2050"], relations: ["ko_p2050"]},
    {code: "ko_psl", label: "KO + PSL", members: ["ko", "psl"], gates: ["ko_psl"], relations: ["ko_psl"]},
    {code: "pis_konf", label: "PiS + Konfederacja", members: ["pis", "konf"], gates: ["pis_konf"], relations: ["pis_konf"]},
    {code: "pis_psl", label: "PiS + PSL", members: ["pis", "psl"], gates: ["pis_psl"], relations: ["pis_psl"]},
    {code: "pis_p2050", label: "PiS + Poland 2050", members: ["pis", "p2050"], gates: ["pis_p2050"], relations: ["pis_p2050"]},
    {code: "ko_konf", label: "KO + Konfederacja", members: ["ko", "konf"], gates: ["ko_konf"], relations: ["ko_konf"]},
    {code: "ko_third", label: "KO + Third Way", members: ["ko", "p2050", "psl"], gates: ["ko_p2050", "ko_psl", "psl_p2050"], relations: ["ko_p2050", "ko_psl", "psl_p2050"]},
    {code: "pis_third", label: "PiS + Third Way", members: ["pis", "p2050", "psl"], gates: ["pis_p2050", "pis_psl", "psl_p2050"], relations: ["pis_p2050", "pis_psl", "psl_p2050"]},
    {code: "pis_konf_psl", label: "PiS + Konfederacja + PSL", members: ["pis", "konf", "psl"], gates: ["pis_konf", "pis_psl", "psl_konf"], relations: ["pis_konf", "pis_psl", "psl_konf"]},
    {code: "pis_konf_p2050", label: "PiS + Konfederacja + Poland 2050", members: ["pis", "konf", "p2050"], gates: ["pis_konf", "pis_p2050", "konf_p2050"], relations: ["pis_konf", "pis_p2050", "konf_p2050"]},
    {code: "pis_konf_third", label: "PiS + Konfederacja + Third Way", members: ["pis", "konf", "p2050", "psl"], gates: ["pis_konf", "pis_p2050", "pis_psl", "konf_p2050", "psl_konf", "psl_p2050"], relations: ["pis_konf", "pis_p2050", "pis_psl", "konf_p2050", "psl_konf", "psl_p2050"]}
];
for (const candidate of candidates) {
    candidate.seats = candidate.members.reduce(function(total, party) {
        return total + seatMap[party];
    }, 0);
    candidate.trust = candidate.relations.reduce(function(total, key) {
        return total + relation(key);
    }, 0) / candidate.relations.length;
}
// ponytail: deterministic minimal-winning coalition with one multiparty
// readiness floor; add policy utilities only if authored preferences arrive.
const viable = candidates.filter(function(candidate) {
    return candidate.seats >= majority &&
        (candidate.members.length <= 2 || candidate.trust >= 45) &&
        candidate.gates.every(function(key) {
            return Number(Q["coalition_viable_" + key]) == 1;
        });
}).sort(function(a, b) {
    return a.members.length - b.members.length ||
        b.trust - a.trust || a.seats - b.seats;
});
if (!viable.length) {
    Q.formation_autonomous_code = "none";
    Q.formation_autonomous_members = [];
} else {
    const selected = viable[0];
    const leader = selected.members.reduce(function(best, party) {
        return seatMap[party] > seatMap[best] ? party : best;
    }, selected.members[0]);
    const premiers = {
        pis: Number(Q.year) == 2023
            ? "Mateusz Morawiecki" : (Q.pis_leader || "PiS nominee"),
        ko: Q.ko_leader || "Donald Tusk",
        p2050: Q.holownia_warsaw_mayor
            ? "Katarzyna Pełczyńska-Nałęcz"
            : (Q.p2050_leader || "Szymon Hołownia"),
        psl: Q.psl_leader || "Władysław Kosiniak-Kamysz",
        konf: Q.konf_leader || "Sławomir Mentzen"
    };
    let speaker = selected.members.includes("p2050") &&
        !Q.holownia_warsaw_mayor &&
        premiers[leader] != "Szymon Hołownia"
        ? "Szymon Hołownia"
        : (selected.members.includes("psl")
            ? "Marek Sawicki"
            : (selected.members.includes("ko")
                ? "Małgorzata Kidawa-Błońska"
                : (selected.members.includes("pis")
                    ? "Elżbieta Witek" : "Krzysztof Bosak")));
    Q.formation_autonomous_code = selected.code;
    Q.formation_autonomous_label = selected.label;
    Q.formation_autonomous_members = selected.members;
    Q.formation_autonomous_seats = selected.seats;
    Q.formation_autonomous_leader = leader;
    Q.formation_autonomous_premier = premiers[leader];
    Q.formation_autonomous_speaker = speaker;
    if (!Q.third_way_split &&
        selected.members.includes("psl") != selected.members.includes("p2050")) {
        Q.third_way_split = 1;
        Q.third_way_active = 0;
        Q.third_way_joint_list = 0;
        Q.third_way_display_name = "PSL and Poland 2050";
        Q.third_way_future = "Split when only one member joined the cabinet";
    }
}
} else {
    const selected = sharedAutonomous.result;
    const members = selected.cabinet.filter(function(party) {
        return party.id != "lewica";
    }).map(function(party) { return party.id; });
    const speaker = members.includes("p2050") &&
        !Q.holownia_warsaw_mayor &&
        sharedAutonomous.premier != "Szymon Hołownia"
            ? "Szymon Hołownia"
            : (members.includes("psl") ? "Marek Sawicki"
                : (members.includes("ko") ? "Małgorzata Kidawa-Błońska"
                    : (members.includes("pis") ? "Elżbieta Witek"
                        : "Krzysztof Bosak")));
    Q.formation_autonomous_code = sharedAutonomous.code;
    Q.formation_autonomous_label =
        selected.name.polish + " — " + selected.name.english;
    Q.formation_autonomous_members = members;
    Q.formation_autonomous_seats = selected.formal_seats;
    Q.formation_autonomous_support_seats = selected.effective_seats;
    Q.formation_autonomous_leader = sharedAutonomous.leader;
    Q.formation_autonomous_premier = sharedAutonomous.premier;
    Q.formation_autonomous_speaker = speaker;
    if (!Q.third_way_split &&
        members.includes("psl") != members.includes("p2050")) {
        Q.third_way_split = 1;
        Q.third_way_active = 0;
        Q.third_way_joint_list = 0;
        Q.third_way_display_name = "PSL and Poland 2050";
        Q.third_way_future = "Split when only one member joined the cabinet";
    }
}
!}
go-to: autonomous_majority if formation_autonomous_code != "none"; first_sitting if formation_autonomous_code = "none"

@autonomous_majority
title: A majority forms without Lewica
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
const majority = Math.max(1, Number(Q.sejm_statutory_majority) || 231);
const pisSeats = Math.max(0, Number(Q.pis_seats) || 0);
const koSeats = Math.max(0, Number(Q.ko_seats) || 0);
const p2050Seats = Math.max(0, Number(Q.p2050_seats) || 0);
const pslSeats = Math.max(0, Number(Q.psl_seats) || 0);
let code = String(Q.formation_autonomous_code || "none");
let label = String(Q.formation_autonomous_label || "");
let members = Array.isArray(Q.formation_autonomous_members)
    ? Q.formation_autonomous_members.slice() : [];
let seats = Number(Q.formation_autonomous_seats) || 0;
let supportSeats = Number(Q.formation_autonomous_support_seats) || seats;
let leader = String(Q.formation_autonomous_leader || "");
let premier = String(Q.formation_autonomous_premier || "");
let speaker = String(Q.formation_autonomous_speaker || "");
if (!members.length && pisSeats >= majority) {
    code = "pis_majority";
    label = "PiS self-sufficient majority";
    members = ["pis"];
    seats = pisSeats;
    leader = "pis";
    premier = Number(Q.year) == 2023
        ? "Mateusz Morawiecki"
        : (Q.pis_leader || "PiS nominee");
    speaker = "Elżbieta Witek";
} else if (!members.length && koSeats >= majority) {
    code = "ko_majority";
    label = "KO self-sufficient majority";
    members = ["ko"];
    seats = koSeats;
    leader = "ko";
    premier = Q.ko_leader || "Donald Tusk";
    speaker = "Małgorzata Kidawa-Błońska";
} else if (!members.length) {
    code = "third_way_majority";
    label = "Third Way self-sufficient majority";
    members = ["p2050", "psl"];
    seats = p2050Seats + pslSeats;
    leader = p2050Seats >= pslSeats ? "p2050" : "psl";
    premier = leader == "p2050"
        ? (Q.holownia_warsaw_mayor
            ? "Katarzyna Pełczyńska-Nałęcz"
            : (Q.p2050_leader || "Szymon Hołownia"))
        : (Q.psl_leader || "Władysław Kosiniak-Kamysz");
    speaker = premier == "Szymon Hołownia" || Q.holownia_warsaw_mayor
        ? "Marek Sawicki"
        : "Szymon Hołownia";
}
if (!supportSeats) supportSeats = seats;
if (typeof polandCoalitionModel != "undefined" &&
    (!Q.coalition_builder || Q.coalition_builder.context.mode != "autonomous")) {
    const roles = {};
    for (const party of polandCoalitionModel.parties(Q)) roles[party.id] = "out";
    for (const member of members) roles[member] = "cabinet";
    polandCoalitionModel.initialise(Q, {
        mode: "autonomous", candidate: premier, candidate_family: leader,
        sponsor: leader, seed_current: false, roles: roles,
        locked: polandCoalitionModel.parties(Q).map(function(party) { return party.id; }),
        read_only: true
    });
}
Q.formation_coalition_selected = 1;
Q.formation_coalition_locked = 1;
Q.formation_coalition_code = code;
Q.formation_coalition_label = label;
Q.formation_coalition_members = members;
Q.formation_coalition_seats = seats;
Q.formation_coalition_support_seats = supportSeats;
Q.formation_government_party = leader;
Q.formation_pm_default = premier;
Q.formation_pm_candidate_party = leader;
Q.democratic_candidate = premier;
Q.democratic_candidate_party = leader;
Q.confidence_candidate = premier;
Q.prime_minister_party = leader;
Q.formation_player_in_government = 0;
Q.formation_player_toleration = 0;
Q.left_cabinet_committed = 0;
Q.left_cabinet_model = "Parliamentary opposition";
Q.formation_marshal_nominee = speaker;
Q.formation_marshal_elected = 1;
Q.sejm_speaker = speaker;
Q.sejm_speaker_party = leader;
Q.candidate_pis_votes = members.includes("pis") ? pisSeats : 0;
Q.candidate_ko_votes = members.includes("ko") ? koSeats : 0;
Q.candidate_p2050_votes = members.includes("p2050") ? p2050Seats : 0;
Q.candidate_psl_votes = members.includes("psl") ? pslSeats : 0;
Q.candidate_left_votes = 0;
Q.democratic_votes = supportSeats;
Q.candidate_vote_passed = 1;
Q.candidate_right_absent = 0;
Q.formation_external_left_yes = 0;
Q.formation_external_left_no = 0;
Q.formation_external_left_abstain = 0;
Q.ministry_return_mode = "cabinet_program";
Q.ministry_allocation_mode = "formation";
Q.ministries_finalized = 0;
Q.ministry_count = 0;
Q.left_role_code = "opposition";
Q.government_members = members.slice();
Q.government_supporters = [];
Q.government_majority_type = members.length == 1
    ? "single_party_majority" : "coalition_majority";
Q.government_majority_margin = supportSeats - majority;
const palaceAcceptsMajority = Boolean(Q.trz_inaugurated) || leader == "pis";
Q.presidential_majority_designation = palaceAcceptsMajority ? 1 : 0;
Q.formation_presidential_attempt_resolved = palaceAcceptsMajority ? 0 : 1;
Q.confidence_stage = palaceAcceptsMajority ? 1 : 2;
Q.confidence_mode = palaceAcceptsMajority
    ? "Article 154 presidential first attempt — majority nominee"
    : "Article 154 Sejm initiative — majority nominee";
if (typeof polandCoalitionModel != "undefined") {
    const committed = polandCoalitionModel.commit(Q);
    if (committed.committed) {
        seats = committed.formal_seats;
        supportSeats = committed.effective_seats;
        Q.democratic_votes = supportSeats;
        Q.government_majority_margin = supportSeats - majority;
    }
}
Q.news_headline = label + " names " + premier + " without Lewica";
!}

= The election has already decided who can govern

**[+ formation_coalition_label +]** controls **[+ formation_coalition_seats +]**
seats, **[+ government_majority_margin +]** above the statutory majority. Its
own agreement names **[+ democratic_candidate +]** for prime minister and **[+
formation_marshal_nominee +]** for Marshal. Lewica cannot choose either office
and receives no invitation to divide the ministries.

[? if presidential_majority_designation = 0: President Duda's first nominee
cannot command this chamber. That attempt lapses, and the self-sufficient
majority elects its own nominee at the Sejm stage.?]

Lewica still owns one decision: how its deputies vote on a cabinet that does
not need them.

{!<div class="coalition-builder-host" data-coalition-mode="autonomous"></div>!}

