@right_auction
title: Konfederacja names its price
new-page: true

= The last pool of votes

Konfederacja's **[+ konf_seats +] deputies** are a federation, not a disciplined successor to a
Weimar mass movement. Nationalists want a harder border and culture war;
libertarians want tax concessions; Grzegorz Braun's two closest deputies want
spectacle and impunity. PiS can buy parts of that menu but not assume the whole
club.

[? if trz_freebie_law = "abortion": This time every wing also demands repeal
or administrative non-enforcement of the enacted abortion-rights law. The
price can be paid through hospital instructions before a repeal majority
exists.?][? if trz_freebie_law = "marriage": This time every wing also demands
repeal or administrative non-enforcement of marriage equality. The price can
be paid through registry instructions before a repeal majority exists.?]

The Left's choice is whether to make the auction politically toxic or let the
right negotiate in the hope that its contradictions defeat it.

