unavailable-subtitle: [? if formation_option_democratic < formation_majority_needed: KO, Poland 2050, PSL and Lewica together hold [+ formation_option_democratic +] seats — short of the [+ formation_majority_needed +] a cabinet needs. ?][? if coalition_viable_left_ko = 0 or coalition_viable_left_psl = 0 or coalition_viable_left_p2050 = 0 or coalition_viable_ko_psl = 0 or coalition_viable_ko_p2050 = 0: Distrust and programme distance inside this bloc rule out a joint cabinet contract. ?]
