go-to: formation_vice_bosak

@formation_vice_witek_reject
title: Vote against Witek (historical)
on-arrival: formation_vice_witek_result = "Rejected"; p2050_relation += 2; psl_relation += 2; ko_relation += 1; news_headline = "Witek is rejected for vice-marshal"
go-to: formation_vice_bosak

@formation_vice_bosak
title: Vice-Marshal ballot — Krzysztof Bosak
new-page: true
face-image: img/poland/cards/hostile-interview.webp

= Separate vice-marshal vote 2/2

The chamber now separately votes on Krzysztof Bosak for Konfederacja.

Bosak's nomination gives every faction a different story to tell. KO can
describe it as a procedural concession, PiS can present it as proof that the
old majority still matters, and Lewica can either make the far right visible
or deny it the institutional stage. There is no neutral abstention here: the
presidium will be read as the first map of the new Sejm.

- @formation_vice_bosak_support
- @formation_vice_bosak_reject

