go-to: formation_czarzasty_rotation

@formation_vice_bosak_reject
title: Reject Bosak for vice-marshal
on-arrival: formation_vice_bosak_result = "Rejected"; constitutional_restraint += 1; news_headline = "Bosak's vice-marshal bid fails"
go-to: formation_czarzasty_rotation

@formation_czarzasty_rotation
title: Mid-term Marshal rotation question
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
const partnerTrust = Math.round(
    ((Number(Q.ko_relation) || 0) +
        (Number(Q.p2050_relation) || 0) +
        (Number(Q.psl_relation) || 0)) / 3
);
Q.formation_czarzasty_rotation = partnerTrust >= 48
    ? "Czarzasty can plausibly win a later rotation vote"
    : "Partners keep Hołownia to term end";
if (partnerTrust < 48) {
    Q.sejm_speaker = Q.holownia_warsaw_mayor
        ? "Marek Sawicki" : "Szymon Hołownia";
}
!}

= Rotation is not automatic

If partner relations deteriorate, KO and Third Way keep Hołownia to the end of
term and block a later Czarzasty rotation.

- @formation_pm_stage

@formation_pm_stage
title: Prime-ministerial designation stage
go-to: formation_duda_first_attempt if year = 2023 and president_name = "Andrzej Duda" and presidential_majority_designation = 1 and formation_presidential_attempt_resolved = 0; formation_pm_rival_auto if not (year = 2023 and president_name = "Andrzej Duda" and presidential_majority_designation = 1 and formation_presidential_attempt_resolved = 0) and formation_rival_automatic_pm = 1; formation_pm_alt if not (year = 2023 and president_name = "Andrzej Duda" and presidential_majority_designation = 1 and formation_presidential_attempt_resolved = 0) and formation_rival_automatic_pm != 1

@formation_duda_first_attempt
title: Duda's first constitutional attempt
new-page: true

President Andrzej Duda has designated **Mateusz Morawiecki**. That designation
does not let the Palace replace the coalition contract: Morawiecki may use the
first attempt if PiS is a formal member, while every other nominee must wait
until the attempt lapses or fails and initiative passes to the Sejm.

- @formation_duda_use_morawiecki
- @formation_duda_attempt_lapses

@formation_duda_use_morawiecki
title: Let Morawiecki use Duda's first attempt
subtitle: Available only to a cabinet that formally includes PiS.
view-if: formation_pis_cabinet_committed = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.formation_presidential_attempt_resolved = 1;
Q.democratic_candidate = "Mateusz Morawiecki";
Q.confidence_candidate = "Mateusz Morawiecki";
Q.formation_pm_candidate_loss = 0;
Q.formation_pm_candidate_party = "pis";
Q.democratic_candidate_party = "pis";
Q.prime_minister_party = "pis";
Q.candidate_code = 4;
Q.news_headline = "Morawiecki uses Duda's first constitutional attempt";
!}
go-to: formation_pm_alt_roll

@formation_duda_attempt_lapses
title: Let Duda's Morawiecki attempt lapse
subtitle: Preserve the signed coalition and move its full nominee slate to the Sejm attempt.
on-arrival: {!
Q.formation_presidential_attempt_resolved = 1;
Q.presidential_majority_designation = 0;
Q.confidence_stage = 2;
Q.confidence_mode = "Article 154 Sejm initiative — candidate selection";
Q.democratic_candidate = "Undecided";
Q.confidence_candidate = "Undecided";
Q.news_headline = "Duda's first attempt lapses and the signed coalition moves to the Sejm";
!}
go-to: formation_pm_rival_auto if formation_rival_automatic_pm = 1; formation_pm_alt

@formation_selected_first_attempt_fails
title: The first attempt fails; the signed coalition survives
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.formation_presidential_attempt_resolved = 1;
Q.presidential_majority_designation = 0;
Q.confidence_stage = 2;
Q.confidence_mode = "Article 154 Sejm initiative — candidate selection";
Q.democratic_candidate = "Undecided";
Q.confidence_candidate = "Undecided";
Q.formation_pm_candidate_loss = 0;
Q.candidate_vote_passed = 0;
Q.cabinet_confidence_passed = 0;
Q.ministries_finalized = 0;
Q.ministry_allocation_mode = "formation";
Q.news_headline = "The presidential attempt fails without dissolving the coalition contract";
!}

The Palace has exhausted its first attempt. The Marshal now receives a nominee
from the coalition already signed; no party is forced to renegotiate its
membership merely because Morawiecki failed.

- @formation_pm_alt: Choose the Sejm-stage nominee

@formation_pm_rival_auto
title: The replacement majority names its leader
on-arrival: {!
Q.formation_pm_contract_support = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.round(Number(Q.formation_coalition_support_seats) || 0)
);
Q.formation_pm_threshold =
    Math.max(1, Math.round(Number(Q.sejm_statutory_majority) || 231));
const konfAutomatic = Q.formation_government_party == "konf";
Q.democratic_candidate = konfAutomatic
    ? Q.konf_pm_candidate : "Mateusz Morawiecki";
Q.confidence_candidate = Q.democratic_candidate;
Q.formation_pm_candidate_loss = 0;
Q.formation_pm_candidate_party = konfAutomatic ? "konf" : "pis";
Q.democratic_candidate_party = Q.formation_pm_candidate_party;
Q.prime_minister_party = Q.formation_pm_candidate_party;
Q.candidate_code = konfAutomatic ? 7 : 4;
Q.news_headline = Q.formation_coalition_label + " names " +
    Q.democratic_candidate;
!}
go-to: formation_pm_alt_roll

@formation_pm_alt
title: Nominate a prime minister for the selected coalition
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.confidence_stage = Q.presidential_majority_designation ? 1 : 2;
Q.confidence_mode = Q.presidential_majority_designation
    ? "Article 154 presidential first attempt — candidate selection"
    : "Article 154 Sejm initiative — candidate selection";
// Who is actually inside the signed contract. Used both to offer the right
// nominees and to gray out the ones this coalition cannot elect.
const code = String(Q.formation_coalition_code || "none")
    .replace(/_tolerated$/, "");
const members = Array.isArray(Q.formation_coalition_members)
    ? Q.formation_coalition_members : [];
const hasMember = function(party) { return members.includes(party); };
Q.formation_pm_has_ko = [
    "democratic_2023", "ko_psl_left", "ko_p2050_left", "ko_left",
    "ko_third", "ko_konf"
].includes(code) || hasMember("ko") || Q.formation_government_party == "ko" ? 1 : 0;
Q.formation_pm_has_psl = [
    "democratic_2023", "ko_psl_left", "third_left_pis",
    "pis_konf_third", "pis_konf_psl", "ko_third", "pis_psl",
    "pis_third", "pis_psl_konf", "pis_third_konf"
].includes(code) || hasMember("psl") || Q.formation_government_party == "psl" ? 1 : 0;
Q.formation_pm_has_p2050 = [
    "democratic_2023", "ko_p2050_left", "third_left_pis",
    "pis_konf_third", "ko_third", "pis_third", "pis_third_konf"
].includes(code) || hasMember("p2050") || Q.formation_government_party == "p2050" ? 1 : 0;
Q.formation_pm_has_left =
    Q.formation_player_in_government ? 1 : 0;
Q.formation_pm_has_pis = [
    "left_pis", "pis_konf", "pis_konf_third", "pis_konf_psl",
    "pis_psl", "pis_third", "pis_psl_konf", "pis_third_konf"
].includes(code) || hasMember("pis") || Q.formation_government_party == "pis" ? 1 : 0;
Q.formation_pm_has_konf = [
    "left_pis_konf", "left_pis_konf_psl", "left_pis_konf_p2050",
    "left_pis_konf_third", "pis_konf", "pis_konf_third",
    "pis_konf_psl", "pis_psl_konf", "pis_third_konf", "ko_konf"
].includes(code) || hasMember("konf") || Q.formation_government_party == "konf" ? 1 : 0;
Q.formation_pm_miller_sps =
    Q.formation_miller_konf_exception && hasMember("konf") ? 1 : 0;
Q.formation_pm_contract_support = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.round(Number(Q.formation_coalition_support_seats) || 0)
);
Q.formation_pm_threshold =
    Math.max(1, Math.round(Number(Q.sejm_statutory_majority) || 231));
// Nominee-specific defections, published so each option can show its own
// margin instead of hiding the arithmetic until after the whip count.
const koSeats = Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.ko_seats) || 0));
const pslSeats = Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.psl_seats) || 0));
const p2050Seats = Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.p2050_seats) || 0));
Q.formation_pm_loss_partner = 0;
Q.formation_pm_loss_trzaskowski = 2;
Q.formation_pm_loss_nowacka = 4;
Q.formation_pm_loss_sikorski = 3;
// A Left premier costs the contract the deputies who signed for arithmetic
// rather than for a Left cabinet. A Lewica-only contract has none of those.
Q.formation_pm_loss_left = [
    "left_only", "left_p2050", "left_psl", "left_third"
].includes(code)
    ? 0
    : (code.indexOf("left_pis") === 0
        ? 8 : Math.max(4, Math.round(koSeats * 0.08)));
const leftSeats = Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.left_committed_seats) || 0));
const pisSeats = Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.pis_seats) || 0));
const konfFamilySeats = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.round(Number(Q.konf_family_seats) || Number(Q.konf_seats) || 0)
);
const memberSeatMap = {
    lewica: leftSeats,
    pis: pisSeats,
    ko: koSeats,
    psl: pslSeats,
    p2050: p2050Seats,
    konf: konfFamilySeats
};
const largestFormalPartner = members.reduce(function(largest, member) {
    return Math.max(largest, Number(memberSeatMap[member]) || 0);
}, 0);
Q.formation_pm_konf_lead = Q.formation_pm_has_konf &&
    konfFamilySeats >= largestFormalPartner ? 1 : 0;
Q.formation_pm_konf_name = Q.konf_pm_candidate || "Krzysztof Bosak";
const konfSiblingSeats = Q.mentzen_bosak_split == 1
    ? (Q.formation_pm_konf_name == "Sławomir Mentzen"
        ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.national_movement_seats) || 0)
        : Math.max(0, Number(Q.new_hope_seats) || 0))
    : 0;
Q.formation_pm_loss_konf =
    Math.min(8, leftSeats) + Math.min(5, koSeats) +
    Math.min(3, pslSeats) + Math.ceil(konfSiblingSeats * 0.25);
Q.formation_pm_loss_szydlo = Math.min(3, leftSeats);
Q.formation_pm_loss_czarnek =
    Math.min(10, leftSeats) + Math.min(3, pslSeats) + Math.min(4, p2050Seats);
Q.formation_pm_loss_kowalczyk = Math.min(3, pisSeats);
Q.formation_pm_loss_zgorzelski = Math.min(2, p2050Seats);
Q.formation_pm_loss_hetman = Math.min(2, pisSeats);
Q.formation_pm_loss_pelczynska = Math.min(2, pisSeats);
Q.formation_pm_loss_hennig = Math.min(4, pisSeats) + Math.min(2, pslSeats);
Q.formation_pm_loss_wieczorek = Math.min(2, pisSeats) +
    (hasMember("konf") ? Math.min(2, Number(Q.konf_seats) || 0) : 0);
Q.formation_pm_loss_jaruzelska = hasMember("p2050")
    ? Math.min(3, p2050Seats) : 0;
Q.formation_pm_designee =
    String(Q.formation_president_nominee || "");
Q.formation_pm_designee_available =
    Q.formation_pm_designee != "" &&
    Q.formation_pm_designee != Q.president_name ? 1 : 0;
Q.formation_pm_ko_name = Q.ko_leader || "KO nominee";
Q.formation_pm_psl_name = Q.psl_leader || "PSL nominee";
Q.formation_pm_pis_name = Number(Q.year) == 2023
    ? "Mateusz Morawiecki"
    : (Q.pis_leader || Q.formation_pm_default || "PiS nominee");
Q.formation_pm_p2050_name = Q.holownia_warsaw_mayor
    ? "Katarzyna Pełczyńska-Nałęcz"
    : (Q.p2050_leader || "Poland 2050 nominee");
// Party leadership may be collective; the constitutional nominee cannot be.
Q.prime_minister_left_nominee = String(
    Q.left_leader || "Włodzimierz Czarzasty"
).split(" and ")[0].trim();
!}

= Nominee after coalition and Marshal

The coalition sequence has completed. **[+ formation_coalition_label +]** can
pledge **[+ formation_pm_contract_support +]** votes and needs **[+
formation_pm_threshold +]**. Every nominee below spends some of that margin;
the ones this contract cannot elect are shown with the shortfall instead of
being hidden.

- @formation_pm_alt_designee
- @formation_pm_alt_morawiecki
- @formation_pm_alt_konf
- @formation_pm_alt_szydlo
- @formation_pm_alt_czarnek
- @formation_pm_alt_kowalczyk
- @formation_pm_alt_czarzasty
- @formation_pm_alt_tusk
- @formation_pm_alt_kosiniak
- @formation_pm_alt_zgorzelski
- @formation_pm_alt_hetman
- @formation_pm_alt_p2050_leader
- @formation_pm_alt_p2050_menu: Nominate a Poland 2050 candidate
- @formation_pm_alt_trzaskowski
- @formation_pm_alt_nowacka
- @formation_pm_alt_sikorski
- @formation_pm_alt_sps_menu: Nominate an SPS candidate
- @formation_pm_alt_left_menu: Nominate a Lewica compromise candidate
- @formation_pm_alt_none

@formation_pm_alt_none
title: Present no nominee and let this attempt lapse
subtitle: Nobody on the list can be carried by the contract that was signed. The initiative passes on.
on-arrival: {!
Q.democratic_candidate = "No nominee presented";
Q.confidence_candidate = "No nominee presented";
Q.formation_pm_candidate_loss = 0;
Q.candidate_vote_passed = 0;
Q.confidence_yes = 0;
Q.confidence_mode = "Attempt lapsed — no appointable nominee";
Q.public_trust -= 2;
Q.news_headline =
    Q.formation_coalition_label + " cannot produce an appointable premier";
!}
go-to: formation_pm_alt_continue

@formation_pm_alt_designee
title: Confirm President [+ president_name +]'s designation of [+ formation_pm_designee +]
subtitle: The Palace moved first. Accepting its nominee costs the coalition nothing beyond the appearance of following.
view-if: formation_pm_designee_available = 1 and formation_pm_designee != formation_pm_ko_name and formation_pm_designee != formation_pm_psl_name and formation_pm_designee != "Mateusz Morawiecki"
choose-if: formation_pm_contract_support >= formation_pm_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: The signed contract pledges [+ formation_pm_contract_support +] of the [+ formation_pm_threshold +] votes this cabinet needs.
on-arrival: {!
Q.democratic_candidate = Q.formation_pm_designee;
Q.confidence_candidate = Q.formation_pm_designee;
Q.formation_pm_candidate_loss = 0;
Q.candidate_code = 6;
Q.news_headline =
    "The coalition accepts the Palace nominee " + Q.formation_pm_designee;
!}
go-to: formation_pm_alt_roll

@formation_pm_alt_morawiecki
title: Nominate [+ formation_pm_pis_name +]
subtitle: PiS's own nominee; the signed cross-bloc contract supplies the remaining formal-party votes.
view-if: formation_pm_has_pis = 1 and formation_pm_pis_name != president_name
choose-if: formation_pm_contract_support >= formation_pm_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: The signed contract pledges [+ formation_pm_contract_support +] of the [+ formation_pm_threshold +] votes this cabinet needs.
on-arrival: {!
Q.democratic_candidate = Q.formation_pm_pis_name;
Q.confidence_candidate = Q.formation_pm_pis_name;
Q.formation_pm_candidate_loss = 0;
Q.candidate_code = 4;
Q.news_headline = "The selected coalition nominates " + Q.formation_pm_pis_name;
!}
go-to: formation_pm_alt_roll

@formation_pm_alt_konf
title: Nominate [+ formation_pm_konf_name +]
subtitle: The leading Konfederacja wing claims the premiership; sibling and centrist defections cost [+ formation_pm_loss_konf +] votes.
view-if: formation_pm_has_konf = 1 and formation_pm_konf_lead = 1 and formation_pm_konf_name != president_name
choose-if: formation_pm_contract_support - formation_pm_loss_konf >= formation_pm_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: The radical-right nominee retains only [+ formation_pm_contract_support - formation_pm_loss_konf +] of the [+ formation_pm_threshold +] votes required.
on-arrival: {!
Q.democratic_candidate = Q.formation_pm_konf_name;
Q.confidence_candidate = Q.formation_pm_konf_name;
Q.formation_pm_candidate_loss = Q.formation_pm_loss_konf;
Q.formation_pm_candidate_party = "konf";
Q.democratic_candidate_party = "konf";
Q.prime_minister_party = "konf";
Q.formation_government_party = "konf";
Q.candidate_code = 7;
Q.far_right_agenda += 5;
Q.far_right_fragmentation += 8;
Q.konf_normalisation += 6;
Q.minority_safety -= 4;
Q.news_headline = Q.formation_pm_konf_name +
    " becomes the coalition's candidate for prime minister";
!}
go-to: formation_pm_alt_roll

@formation_pm_alt_szydlo
title: Nominate Beata Szydło
subtitle: A welfare-conservative return costs [+ formation_pm_loss_szydlo +] Left votes; projected support: [+ formation_pm_contract_support - formation_pm_loss_szydlo +].
view-if: year = 2023 and formation_pm_has_pis = 1 and president_name != "Beata Szydło"
choose-if: formation_pm_contract_support - formation_pm_loss_szydlo >= formation_pm_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: Her projected support falls below [+ formation_pm_threshold +].
on-arrival: democratic_candidate = "Beata Szydło"; confidence_candidate = "Beata Szydło"; formation_pm_candidate_loss = formation_pm_loss_szydlo; labor_credibility += 2; progressives_dissent += 3; news_headline = "The coalition nominates Szydło on a welfare-conservative compact"
go-to: formation_pm_alt_roll

@formation_pm_alt_czarnek
title: Nominate Przemysław Czarnek
subtitle: The hard-right bid loses [+ formation_pm_loss_czarnek +] contracted votes; projected support: [+ formation_pm_contract_support - formation_pm_loss_czarnek +].
view-if: year = 2023 and formation_pm_has_pis = 1 and president_name != "Przemysław Czarnek"
choose-if: formation_pm_contract_support - formation_pm_loss_czarnek >= formation_pm_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: His defections leave the coalition below [+ formation_pm_threshold +].
on-arrival: democratic_candidate = "Przemysław Czarnek"; confidence_candidate = "Przemysław Czarnek"; formation_pm_candidate_loss = formation_pm_loss_czarnek; far_right_agenda += 5; minority_safety -= 5; progressives_dissent += 8; news_headline = "PiS tests whether Czarnek can survive the cross-bloc contract"
go-to: formation_pm_alt_roll

@formation_pm_alt_kowalczyk
title: Nominate Henryk Kowalczyk
subtitle: An agrarian-apparatus compromise loses [+ formation_pm_loss_kowalczyk +] PiS hardliners; projected support: [+ formation_pm_contract_support - formation_pm_loss_kowalczyk +].
view-if: year = 2023 and formation_pm_has_pis = 1 and president_name != "Henryk Kowalczyk"
choose-if: formation_pm_contract_support - formation_pm_loss_kowalczyk >= formation_pm_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: His projected support falls below [+ formation_pm_threshold +].
on-arrival: democratic_candidate = "Henryk Kowalczyk"; confidence_candidate = "Henryk Kowalczyk"; formation_pm_candidate_loss = formation_pm_loss_kowalczyk; rural_support += 3; psl_relation += 2 if formation_pm_has_psl = 1; news_headline = "Kowalczyk becomes the rural compromise nominee"
go-to: formation_pm_alt_roll

@formation_pm_alt_czarzasty
title: Nominate [+ prime_minister_left_nominee +]
subtitle: The Left claims the premiership itself; partners who signed for arithmetic did not sign for this.
view-if: formation_pm_has_left = 1 and formation_pm_miller_sps = 0 and prime_minister_left_nominee != president_name and prime_minister_left_nominee != "Agnieszka Dziemianowicz-Bąk" and prime_minister_left_nominee != "Magdalena Biejat" and prime_minister_left_nominee != "Krzysztof Gawkowski" and prime_minister_left_nominee != "Katarzyna Kotula"
choose-if: formation_pm_contract_support - formation_pm_loss_left >= formation_pm_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: After the defections a Left premier provokes, only [+ formation_pm_contract_support - formation_pm_loss_left +] of [+ formation_pm_threshold +] votes remain.
on-arrival: {!
Q.democratic_candidate = Q.prime_minister_left_nominee;
Q.confidence_candidate = Q.democratic_candidate;
Q.formation_pm_candidate_loss = Q.formation_pm_loss_left;
Q.candidate_code = 5;
Q.news_headline = Q.democratic_candidate + " is nominated after the office ballots";
!}
go-to: formation_pm_alt_roll

@formation_pm_alt_tusk
title: Nominate [+ formation_pm_ko_name +]
subtitle: KO's own leader. The safest arithmetic and the least leverage for everyone else.
view-if: formation_pm_has_ko = 1 and formation_pm_ko_name != formation_pm_designee
choose-if: formation_pm_contract_support >= formation_pm_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: The signed contract pledges [+ formation_pm_contract_support +] of the [+ formation_pm_threshold +] votes this cabinet needs.
on-arrival: {!
Q.democratic_candidate = Q.formation_pm_ko_name;
Q.confidence_candidate = Q.formation_pm_ko_name;
Q.formation_pm_candidate_loss = 0;
Q.candidate_code = 1;
Q.news_headline =
    "The selected coalition nominates " + Q.formation_pm_ko_name;
!}
go-to: formation_pm_alt_roll

@formation_pm_alt_kosiniak
title: Nominate [+ formation_pm_psl_name +]
subtitle: An agrarian-centrist premiership buys rural deputies and irritates the progressive wing.
view-if: formation_pm_has_psl = 1 and formation_pm_psl_name != formation_pm_designee
choose-if: formation_pm_contract_support >= formation_pm_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: The signed contract pledges [+ formation_pm_contract_support +] of the [+ formation_pm_threshold +] votes this cabinet needs.
on-arrival: {!
Q.democratic_candidate = Q.formation_pm_psl_name;
Q.confidence_candidate = Q.formation_pm_psl_name;
Q.formation_pm_candidate_loss = 0;
Q.candidate_code = 2;
Q.news_headline =
    "The rural wing names " + Q.formation_pm_psl_name + " for the premiership";
Q.psl_relation += 4;
!}
go-to: formation_pm_alt_roll

@formation_pm_alt_zgorzelski
title: Nominate Piotr Zgorzelski
subtitle: An institutional PSL candidacy loses [+ formation_pm_loss_zgorzelski +] Poland 2050 votes; projected support: [+ formation_pm_contract_support - formation_pm_loss_zgorzelski +].
view-if: year = 2023 and formation_pm_has_psl = 1 and president_name != "Piotr Zgorzelski"
choose-if: formation_pm_contract_support - formation_pm_loss_zgorzelski >= formation_pm_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: His projected support falls below [+ formation_pm_threshold +].
on-arrival: democratic_candidate = "Piotr Zgorzelski"; confidence_candidate = "Piotr Zgorzelski"; formation_pm_candidate_loss = formation_pm_loss_zgorzelski; constitutional_restraint += 2; psl_relation += 3; news_headline = "PSL nominates Zgorzelski as the institutional compromise"
go-to: formation_pm_alt_roll

@formation_pm_alt_hetman
title: Nominate Krzysztof Hetman
subtitle: A development-focused PSL bid loses [+ formation_pm_loss_hetman +] PiS votes; projected support: [+ formation_pm_contract_support - formation_pm_loss_hetman +].
view-if: year = 2023 and formation_pm_has_psl = 1 and president_name != "Krzysztof Hetman"
choose-if: formation_pm_contract_support - formation_pm_loss_hetman >= formation_pm_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: His projected support falls below [+ formation_pm_threshold +].
on-arrival: democratic_candidate = "Krzysztof Hetman"; confidence_candidate = "Krzysztof Hetman"; formation_pm_candidate_loss = formation_pm_loss_hetman; psl_relation += 2; economic_growth += 0.1; news_headline = "Hetman is offered as the development-first premier"
go-to: formation_pm_alt_roll

@formation_pm_alt_p2050_menu
title: Poland 2050 nominates a prime minister
new-page: true
view-if: year = 2023 and formation_pm_has_p2050 = 1

Poland 2050 can claim the premiership only when it accepted formal cabinet
responsibility. An outside supporter receives no nominee.

- @formation_pm_p2050_holownia
- @formation_pm_p2050_pelczynska
- @formation_pm_p2050_hennig
- @formation_pm_alt: Return to the full nominee list

@formation_pm_alt_p2050_leader
title: Nominate [+ formation_pm_p2050_name +]
subtitle: Later formations use Poland 2050's current leader rather than the fixed 2023 slate.
view-if: year != 2023 and formation_pm_has_p2050 = 1 and formation_pm_p2050_name != president_name and (holownia_warsaw_mayor = 0 or formation_pm_p2050_name != "Szymon Hołownia")
choose-if: formation_pm_contract_support >= formation_pm_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: The signed contract pledges [+ formation_pm_contract_support +] of the [+ formation_pm_threshold +] votes this cabinet needs.
on-arrival: {!
Q.democratic_candidate = Q.formation_pm_p2050_name;
Q.confidence_candidate = Q.formation_pm_p2050_name;
Q.formation_pm_candidate_loss = 0;
Q.candidate_code = 3;
Q.news_headline = "Poland 2050 nominates " + Q.formation_pm_p2050_name;
!}
go-to: formation_pm_holownia_replacement if democratic_candidate = "Szymon Hołownia" and sejm_speaker = "Szymon Hołownia"; formation_pm_alt_roll

@formation_pm_p2050_holownia
title: Nominate Szymon Hołownia
subtitle: The party leader holds the contract together without nominee-specific defections.
view-if: president_name != "Szymon Hołownia" and holownia_warsaw_mayor = 0
choose-if: formation_pm_contract_support >= formation_pm_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: The coalition itself is below [+ formation_pm_threshold +].
on-arrival: democratic_candidate = "Szymon Hołownia"; confidence_candidate = "Szymon Hołownia"; formation_pm_candidate_loss = 0; p2050_relation += 4; news_headline = "Poland 2050 nominates Hołownia for prime minister"
go-to: formation_pm_holownia_replacement if sejm_speaker = "Szymon Hołownia"; formation_pm_alt_roll

@formation_pm_holownia_replacement
title: Hołownia cannot hold two constitutional offices
new-page: true

Hołownia must leave the Marshal's chair before seeking confidence as prime
minister. The coalition proposes Marek Sawicki as the replacement Marshal.

- @formation_pm_holownia_replace_sawicki
- @formation_pm_holownia_cancel

@formation_pm_holownia_replace_sawicki
title: Elect Marek Sawicki and continue with Hołownia
on-arrival: sejm_speaker = "Marek Sawicki"; formation_marshal_nominee = "Marek Sawicki"; formation_marshal_elected = 1; constitutional_restraint += 2; news_headline = "Sawicki replaces Hołownia as Marshal before the PM vote"
go-to: formation_pm_alt_roll

@formation_pm_holownia_cancel
title: Keep Hołownia as Marshal and choose another premier
