@formation_pm_alt_left_menu
title: Nominate a Lewica compromise candidate
subtitle: A Left premier can pull defectors past the red benches; part of KO will not follow.
new-page: true
view-if: year = 2023 and formation_pm_has_left = 1 and formation_pm_miller_sps = 0

= A Left premier has to be a person

Lewica cannot nominate an abstract compromise. Each name uses the same
contract arithmetic — **[+ formation_pm_contract_support +]** pledged against
**[+ formation_pm_threshold +]** needed, minus the **[+ formation_pm_loss_left
+]** deputies a Left premiership is expected to cost — and decides whose
programme the cabinet carries.

- @formation_pm_left_campaign
- @formation_pm_left_dziemianowicz
- @formation_pm_left_biejat
- @formation_pm_left_gawkowski
- @formation_pm_left_kotula
- @formation_pm_alt: Return to the full nominee list

