@cabinet_confidence_roll
title: The cabinet confidence vote
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
const sejmTotal = Math.max(1, Number(Q.sejm_total) || 460);
const requestedCabinetLosses =
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.cabinet_ko_loss) || 0) +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.cabinet_p2050_loss) || 0) +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.cabinet_psl_loss) || 0) +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.cabinet_left_loss) || 0) +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.cabinet_pis_loss) || 0) +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.cabinet_konf_loss) || 0);
const fallbackRightSeats =
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.pis_seats) || 0) +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.konf_seats) || 0) +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.rozwoj_seats) || 0) +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.korona_seats) || 0) +
    (String(Q.social_patriot_list_committee || "") == "pis"
        ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.social_patriot_seats) || 0)
        : 0);
const rightSeats = Math.max(
    0,
    Number.isFinite(Number(Q.coalition_right_seats))
        ? Number(Q.coalition_right_seats)
        : fallbackRightSeats
);
const rightAbsent = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        rightSeats,
        Math.round(Number(Q.candidate_right_absent) || 0)
    )
);
Q.confidence_stage = 3;
Q.confidence_mode = Q.presidential_majority_designation
    ? "Article 154(2) presidential first attempt — absolute majority"
    : "Article 154(3) Sejm election of prime minister and cabinet — absolute majority";
Q.confidence_candidate = Q.democratic_candidate + " cabinet";
if (Q.formation_coalition_selected) {
    const contractedSupport = Math.max(
        0,
        Math.min(
            sejmTotal,
            Math.round(Number(Q.formation_coalition_support_seats) || 0)
        )
    );
    const nomineeSupport = Math.max(
        0,
        Math.min(
            contractedSupport,
            Math.round(Number(Q.democratic_votes) || contractedSupport)
        )
    );
    const nomineeWithholding = contractedSupport - nomineeSupport;
    const cabinetLosses = Math.max(
        0,
        Math.min(nomineeSupport, requestedCabinetLosses)
    );
    const nonSupporters = Math.max(0, sejmTotal - contractedSupport);
    const selectedRightAbsent = Math.min(rightAbsent, nonSupporters);
    const externalLeftYes = Math.min(
        nonSupporters - selectedRightAbsent,
        Math.max(0, Number(Q.formation_external_left_yes) || 0)
    );
    const externalLeftAbstain = Math.min(
        nonSupporters - selectedRightAbsent - externalLeftYes,
        Math.max(0, Number(Q.formation_external_left_abstain) || 0)
    );
    Q.confidence_yes = nomineeSupport - cabinetLosses + externalLeftYes;
    Q.confidence_no = nonSupporters - selectedRightAbsent -
        externalLeftYes - externalLeftAbstain;
    Q.confidence_abstain = nomineeWithholding + cabinetLosses +
        externalLeftAbstain;
} else {
    const pledgedSupport = Math.max(
        0,
        Math.min(sejmTotal, Math.round(Number(Q.democratic_votes) || 0))
    );
    const cabinetLosses = Math.max(
        0,
        Math.min(pledgedSupport, requestedCabinetLosses)
    );
    Q.confidence_yes = pledgedSupport - cabinetLosses;
    Q.confidence_no = Math.max(0, rightSeats - rightAbsent);
    Q.confidence_abstain = Math.max(
        0,
        sejmTotal - rightAbsent - Q.confidence_yes - Q.confidence_no
    );
}
Q.confidence_present =
    Q.confidence_yes + Q.confidence_no + Q.confidence_abstain;
Q.confidence_threshold = Math.floor(Q.confidence_present / 2) + 1;
Q.cabinet_confidence_passed =
    Q.confidence_present >= Q.sejm_quorum_floor &&
    Q.confidence_yes >= Q.confidence_threshold ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.cabinet_confidence_passed) {
    Q.news_headline = Q.democratic_candidate + "'s cabinet wins confidence";
} else {
    Q.news_headline = Q.democratic_candidate + "'s cabinet fails at the last vote";
}
!}

= Confidence in the whole cabinet

<div class="ledger-section ledger-section-first"><div class="ledger-title">Roll
call</div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Programme</span><b>[+ cabinet_program +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Yes</span><b>[+ confidence_yes +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>No</span><b>[+ confidence_no +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Abstain</span><b>[+ confidence_abstain +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Present</span><b>[+ confidence_present +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Required</span><b>[+ confidence_threshold +]</b></div></div>

[? if cabinet_confidence_passed: The cabinet clears the applicable Article 154
stage and is appointed.?]

[? if not cabinet_confidence_passed and presidential_majority_designation:
The President's first cabinet fails. Initiative now passes to the Sejm.?]
[? if not cabinet_confidence_passed and not presidential_majority_designation:
The Sejm-stage cabinet fails, and the President's third attempt is now
decisive.?]

- @cabinet_vote_continue: Continue from the roll call

@cabinet_vote_continue
go-to: cabinet_success if cabinet_confidence_passed = 1; formation_selected_first_attempt_fails if cabinet_confidence_passed = 0 and presidential_majority_designation = 1 and formation_coalition_selected = 1; presidential_first_fails if cabinet_confidence_passed = 0 and presidential_majority_designation = 1; third_attempt if cabinet_confidence_passed = 0 and presidential_majority_designation = 0

@cabinet_success
title: The cabinet takes office
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.formation_complete = 1;
Q.formation_in_progress = 0;
Q.caretaker_government = 0;
Q.government_has_confidence = 1;
Q.prime_minister = Q.democratic_candidate;
Q.prime_minister_intro_return = "formation_government";
Q.prime_minister_intro_pending = 1;
Q.government_name = Q.democratic_candidate + " coalition cabinet";
const leftHeadedCabinet = [
    "Agnieszka Dziemianowicz-Bąk", "Magdalena Biejat",
    "Krzysztof Gawkowski", "Włodzimierz Czarzasty", "Robert Biedroń",
    "Adrian Zandberg", "Anna Maria Żukowska", "Tomasz Trela",
    "Dariusz Wieczorek", "Katarzyna Kotula", "Leszek Miller",
    "Monika Jaruzelska"
].includes(Q.democratic_candidate) ||
    Q.democratic_candidate == Q.prime_minister_left_nominee;
if (Q.formation_coalition_selected) {
    // A negotiated coalition names the cabinet's owner. It does not convert
    // a Lewica prime minister into somebody else's politician, so a Lewica
    // head of a KO-led coalition is recorded as exactly that.
    Q.government_party = leftHeadedCabinet && Q.left_cabinet_committed
        ? "lewica"
        : Q.formation_government_party;
    Q.government_owner = leftHeadedCabinet &&
        String(Q.formation_government_party || "") != "lewica"
        ? Q.formation_coalition_label + " under a Lewica prime minister"
        : Q.formation_coalition_label;
} else if (Q.democratic_candidate == "Donald Tusk") {
    Q.government_party = "ko";
    Q.government_owner = "KO-led democratic coalition";
} else if (Q.democratic_candidate == "Władysław Kosiniak-Kamysz") {
    Q.government_party = "psl";
    Q.government_owner = "PSL-led democratic coalition";
} else if ([
    "Agnieszka Dziemianowicz-Bąk", "Magdalena Biejat",
    "Krzysztof Gawkowski", "Włodzimierz Czarzasty", "Robert Biedroń",
    "Adrian Zandberg", "Anna Maria Żukowska", "Tomasz Trela",
    "Dariusz Wieczorek", "Katarzyna Kotula", "Leszek Miller",
    "Monika Jaruzelska"
].includes(Q.democratic_candidate) ||
    Q.democratic_candidate == Q.prime_minister_left_nominee) {
    // Every Lewica compromise candidate is a Lewica prime minister, not only
    // the party leader; the cabinet's ownership is a separate question.
    Q.government_party = Q.left_cabinet_committed
        ? "lewica" : "independent";
    Q.government_owner = Q.left_cabinet_committed
        ? "Lewica-led democratic coalition"
        : "Lewica-headed parliamentary cabinet";
} else {
    Q.government_party = "other";
    Q.government_owner = Q.democratic_candidate + " parliamentary cabinet";
}
Q.left_in_government = Q.formation_coalition_selected
    ? (Q.formation_player_in_government ? 1 : 0)
    : (Q.left_cabinet_committed ? 1 : 0);
const formationMembers = Array.isArray(Q.formation_coalition_members)
    ? Q.formation_coalition_members.slice() : [];
if (!Q.formation_coalition_selected) {
    for (const party of ["pis", "ko", "p2050", "psl", "konf"]) {
        if (Q["ministry_" + party + "_in_cabinet"] &&
            !formationMembers.includes(party)) {
            formationMembers.push(party);
        }
    }
}
if (Q.left_in_government && !formationMembers.includes("lewica")) {
    formationMembers.push("lewica");
}
Q.government_members = formationMembers;
Q.government_supporters = Q.formation_player_toleration ? ["lewica"] : [];
Q.left_role_code = Q.left_in_government
    ? (Q.government_party == "lewica" ? "lead_government" : "junior_government")
    : (Q.formation_player_toleration ? "confidence_supply" : "opposition");
const formationMajority = Math.max(
    1,
    Number(Q.sejm_statutory_majority) || 231
);
const formalGovernmentSupport = Q.formation_coalition_selected
    ? Number(Q.formation_coalition_support_seats) || 0
    : Number(Q.confidence_yes) || 0;
Q.government_majority_type = formalGovernmentSupport >= formationMajority
    ? (formationMembers.length <= 1
        ? "single_party_majority" : "coalition_majority")
    : "minority_government";
Q.government_majority_margin =
    formalGovernmentSupport - formationMajority;
// A Left premier the larger partners agreed to rather than earned starts the
// term owing them, and the coalition says so from the first week.
const largestCabinetPartner = Math.max(
    Q.ministry_pis_in_cabinet ? Number(Q.pis_seats) || 0 : 0,
    Q.ministry_ko_in_cabinet ? Number(Q.ko_seats) || 0 : 0,
    Q.ministry_psl_in_cabinet ? Number(Q.psl_seats) || 0 : 0,
    Q.ministry_p2050_in_cabinet ? Number(Q.p2050_seats) || 0 : 0,
    Q.ministry_konf_in_cabinet ? Number(Q.konf_seats) || 0 : 0
);
if (
    leftHeadedCabinet && largestCabinetPartner > (Number(Q.left_seats) || 0)
) {
    Q.left_pm_borrowed_mandate = 1;
    Q.left_coalition_dissent = (Number(Q.left_coalition_dissent) || 0) + 6;
    if (Q.ministry_ko_in_cabinet) {
        Q.ko_coalition_dissent = (Number(Q.ko_coalition_dissent) || 0) + 12;
    }
    if (Q.ministry_psl_in_cabinet) {
        Q.psl_coalition_dissent = (Number(Q.psl_coalition_dissent) || 0) + 10;
    }
    if (Q.ministry_p2050_in_cabinet) {
        Q.p2050_coalition_dissent =
            (Number(Q.p2050_coalition_dissent) || 0) + 10;
    }
    Q.government_coalition_dissent =
        (Number(Q.government_coalition_dissent) || 0) + 10;
}
const cabinetPartyLabels = [];
if (Q.ministry_pis_in_cabinet) cabinetPartyLabels.push("PiS");
if (Q.ministry_ko_in_cabinet) cabinetPartyLabels.push("KO");
if (Q.ministry_p2050_in_cabinet) cabinetPartyLabels.push("Poland 2050");
if (Q.ministry_psl_in_cabinet) cabinetPartyLabels.push("PSL");
if (Q.ministry_konf_in_cabinet) cabinetPartyLabels.push("Konfederacja");
if (Q.left_in_government) cabinetPartyLabels.push("Lewica");
let rosterCoalitionSeats = Math.min(
    Number(Q.sejm_total) || 460,
    (Q.ministry_pis_in_cabinet
        ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.pis_seats) || 0)
        : 0) +
    (Q.ministry_ko_in_cabinet
        ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.ko_seats) || 0)
        : 0) +
    (Q.ministry_p2050_in_cabinet
        ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.p2050_seats) || 0)
        : 0) +
    (Q.ministry_psl_in_cabinet
        ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.psl_seats) || 0)
        : 0) +
    (Q.ministry_konf_in_cabinet
        ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.konf_seats) || 0)
        : 0) +
    (Q.left_in_government
        ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.ministry_left_cabinet_seats) || 0)
        : 0)
);
if (Q.formation_coalition_selected) {
    const selectedCoalitionLabel = String(
        Q.formation_coalition_label || "Selected coalition"
    );
    Q.coalition_status = /cabinet$/i.test(selectedCoalitionLabel)
        ? selectedCoalitionLabel
        : selectedCoalitionLabel + " cabinet";
    Q.coalition_seats = Math.max(
        0,
        Number(Q.formation_coalition_seats) || 0
    );
    Q.government_support_seats = Q.formation_player_in_government ||
        Q.formation_player_toleration
        ? Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.confidence_yes) || 0))
        : Math.max(
            0,
            Math.round(Number(Q.formation_coalition_support_seats) || 0)
        );
} else {
    Q.coalition_status = cabinetPartyLabels.length
        ? cabinetPartyLabels.join(" · ") + " cabinet"
        : Q.government_owner;
    Q.coalition_seats = rosterCoalitionSeats;
    Q.government_support_seats = Math.max(
        0,
        Math.round(Number(Q.confidence_yes) || 0)
    );
}
Q.cabinet_roster_government_party = Q.government_party;
const baseFormationCode = String(Q.formation_coalition_code || "none")
    .replace(/_tolerated$/, "");
Q.standard_four_party_cabinet = Q.left_in_government && (
    Q.formation_coalition_selected
        ? baseFormationCode == "democratic_2023"
        : Boolean(
            Q.ministry_ko_in_cabinet &&
            Q.ministry_p2050_in_cabinet &&
            Q.ministry_psl_in_cabinet
        )
) ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.left_in_government) {
    Q.position = "Coalition government";
    Q.budget = 6;
    Q.budget_authority = "Governing coalition — negotiated fiscal capacity";
    Q.ending_name = "The Left enters government";
    if (Q.formation_continuous) {
        Q.formation_outcome_score = 48;
        Q.ending_score =
            (Number.isFinite(Number(Q.ending_score))
                ? Number(Q.ending_score)
                : 0) + 8;
    } else {
        Q.ending_score = 48;
    }
} else {
    Q.position = Q.formation_player_toleration
        ? "Confidence-and-supply opposition"
        : "Parliamentary opposition";
    Q.budget = 0;
    Q.budget_authority = "Opposition — no state spending authority";
    Q.ministries_finalized = 1;
    Q.ministry_allocation_mode = "settled";
    Q.ending_name = Q.formation_player_toleration
        ? "Support without office"
        : "A cabinet without the player";
    if (Q.formation_continuous) {
        Q.formation_outcome_score = Q.formation_player_toleration ? 32 : 24;
        Q.ending_score =
            (Number.isFinite(Number(Q.ending_score))
                ? Number(Q.ending_score)
                : 0) + (Q.formation_player_toleration ? 3 : 0);
    } else {
        Q.ending_score = Q.formation_player_toleration ? 32 : 24;
    }
}
!}

= Office is a constitutional fact

**[+ prime_minister +]** now leads the cabinet. The Left's constitutional
position follows the agreement actually made, not the colour of the deputies
who voted yes.

[? if left_in_government = 1: Lewica has ministers and collective
responsibility. The government budget and coalition-management game is now
available. ?]

[? if left_in_government = 0: Lewica is outside the cabinet. It can bargain
over bills and may have supplied toleration, but it does not control the state
budget and receives no governing-spend actions. ?]

- @poland_prime_minister_intro.show: Meet the new Prime Minister

@formation_tusk_suit
# prose-audit: Grade B — A sharp five-line vignette; "the government is already wearing the smell of PSL's bargaining power" is the best sentence in the file. It is a bulletin with a single Continue and no Lewica decision.
title: Tusk starts wearing the suit
new-page: true
view-if: formation_tusk_suit_done = 0 and president_name = "Andrzej Duda" and democratic_candidate = "Donald Tusk" and candidate_psl_votes > 0 and democratic_votes < 276
