= The cabinet has offices; Lewica needs a theory of opposition

**[+ government_name +]** can survive without Lewica. The next term therefore
cannot be played as a cabinet negotiation waiting to happen. Party resources
fund bills, hearings and organisation; they do not become state spending.

Choose what turns those limited instruments into leverage. This line will
shape the standing opposition operation available from the Leadership Table.

