@third_attempt
title: The President's last attempt
new-page: true

= Article 155 — simple majority, final chance

If the Sejm-led attempt fails, the President appoints another prime minister
and cabinet. The chamber then votes by **more yes than no**, with quorum.
Abstentions no longer raise the majority threshold. If this cabinet also
fails, the President must shorten the Sejm's term.

The Palace, PSL and the exhausted democratic clubs each offer a way to use that
different arithmetic. The Marshal's office was settled at the first sitting;
this final attempt concerns only the cabinet and its confidence vote.

- @third_attempt_menu: Move to third-attempt PM options

@third_marshal_gate
title: Marshal vote gate
view-if: presidential_majority_designation = 0
on-arrival: formation_marshal_vote_choice = "Undecided" if formation_marshal_elected = 0
go-to: third_marshal_ballot if formation_marshal_elected = 0; third_attempt_menu if formation_marshal_elected = 1

@third_marshal_ballot
title: Sejm Marshal ballot before the final PM vote
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
const democraticSeats =
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.ko_seats) || 0) +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.p2050_seats) || 0) +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.psl_seats) || 0) +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_committed_seats) || 0);
const fallbackRightSeats =
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.pis_seats) || 0) +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.konf_seats) || 0) +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.rozwoj_seats) || 0) +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.korona_seats) || 0) +
    (String(Q.social_patriot_list_committee || "") == "pis"
        ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.social_patriot_seats) || 0)
        : 0);
const rightSeats = Math.max(
    0,
    Number.isFinite(Number(Q.coalition_right_seats))
        ? Number(Q.coalition_right_seats)
        : fallbackRightSeats
);
Q.formation_marshal_nominee = democraticSeats >= rightSeats
    ? (Q.holownia_warsaw_mayor ? "Marek Sawicki" : "Szymon Hołownia")
    : "Elżbieta Witek";
Q.formation_marshal_vote_choice = "Undecided";
Q.formation_marshal_compromise = 0;
Q.formation_marshal_ballot_passed = 0;
Q.news_headline =
    "The chamber opens a Marshal ballot before the final PM attempt";
!}

= Constitutional sequencing check

Before the third-attempt PM arithmetic, the chamber settles the Marshal office.

- @third_marshal_support
- @third_marshal_reject
- @third_marshal_abstain

